      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Ultahost VPS Review 2026: Managed KVM from $9.19/mo</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-base">Last updated: August 21, 2026 · 11 min read</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-5">

      <p>Ultahost is one of the more established names in the <strong>managed VPS</strong> space, and it competes on a different axis than the budget unmanaged hosts we usually lead with. Where RackNerd sells bare-bones KVM at $1.99/mo and Vultr sells hourly self-managed cloud, Ultahost bundles <strong>AMD EPYC + NVMe hardware, a 33+ global datacenter footprint, and flexible managed / semi-managed / unmanaged support tiers</strong> into a single product line. We pulled the live pricing and specs from ultahost.com (HTTP 200, fully-rendered pages) to verify exactly what you get for the money — and where the managed-VPS value case breaks down.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Ultahost at a Glance</h2>
      <p>Ultahost (est. 2017) is a budget-to-mid managed host best known for wide location coverage and a straightforward managed-VPS product. Its VPS runs KVM virtualization on SuperMicro servers with <strong>AMD EPYC 4.0–4.2 GHz CPUs and NVMe SSDs on PCIe Gen 5</strong>. The headline feature is the datacenter footprint — <strong>33+ locations</strong> spanning the US, Europe, the Middle East, Singapore, Tokyo, and Sydney — plus a management model that lets you choose how much support you want.</p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
        <li><strong>Founded:</strong> 2017 (established managed host; widely covered by major hosting review outlets)</li>
        <li><strong>Niche:</strong> Managed Linux KVM VPS with a wide global datacenter footprint</li>
        <li><strong>Hardware:</strong> AMD EPYC 4.0–4.2 GHz, NVMe SSD, PCIe Gen 5, KVM virtualization</li>
        <li><strong>Network:</strong> 1 Gbps uplink; unlimited bandwidth on Business and above</li>
        <li><strong>Datacenters:</strong> 33+ worldwide (US: Seattle, Dallas, LA, New York, Chicago; + London, Frankfurt, Amsterdam, Paris, Madrid, Warsaw, Istanbul, Toronto, Singapore, Tokyo, Sydney, and more)</li>
        <li><strong>Management:</strong> Unmanaged / Semi-Managed / Fully Managed tiers, full root access</li>
        <li><strong>Entry plan:</strong> VPS Basic at $9.19/mo (24-month term; 1 vCPU, 1 GB DDR5, 30 GB NVMe)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">Pricing Table (Verified 2026-08-21)</h2>
      <p>All prices below were pulled from <a href="https://ultahost.com/vps-hosting" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">ultahost.com/vps-hosting</a> on August 21, 2026 (HTTP 200, ~930 KB fully-rendered page). Plans are billed up front on a 24-month term; the intro rate renews at the lower 2-year rate shown.</p>

